{
  "about": "Offline rules shared by iOS, web and Android (contract/offline-2026-10-31.md). ago: seconds since the saved answer -> label. notice: what a screen says after a call fails (failed, savedAgo seconds or null, the error) -> the text and whether it's an error, or null when nothing failed. queues: whether a failed collection_apply batch goes into the outbox (ops, network error) -> bool. deltas: the queued adds per item key from outbox batches (ops leave finish nonfoil, condition NM, lang en when unset). shown: a sync row's qty plus the queued deltas for its key.",
